<view class="screen"><challenge-banner order-id="{{orderId}}" bind:leave="leave" /><view class="heading">把微光拼成喜欢的模样</view><view class="subtitle">你做出的每一次选择，都在这里留下痕迹。</view><view wx:if="{{status === 'error'}}" class="error-box" bindtap="load">卡片暂时没有加载 · 重试</view><view wx:if="{{!card && status !== 'error'}}" class="section empty"><view>{{status === 'loading' ? '正在点亮微光…' : '第一次挑战成功后，自动开始你的第一张拼图。'}}</view><button wx:if="{{status === 'ready'}}" class="soft-button stack" bindtap="start">开始一次挑战</button></view><block wx:if="{{card}}"><view class="section"><view class="puzzle" style="{{frameStyle}}"><cloud-image class="picture" src="{{card.fileID}}" mode="aspectFit" placeholder="你的微光图片正在准备中" /><view class="tiles" style="{{gridStyle}}"><view wx:for="{{tiles}}" wx:key="index" class="tile {{item.hidden ? 'covered' : ''}}">{{item.hidden ? '✦' : ''}}</view></view></view><view class="row stack"><view class="section-title">{{card.status === 'completed' ? '这张拼图已集齐' : '已完成 ' + card.currentStep + '/7 次'}}</view><text class="muted">{{card.revealedTileIndexes.length}} / {{card.tileCount}} 块</text></view><view class="progress"><view class="progress-fill" style="width: {{card.currentStep / 7 * 100}}%"></view></view><view class="muted">同一天的每次成功，都能继续点亮。</view></view><view class="section" bindtap="weight"><view class="row"><text class="section-title">{{goal ? '目标体重 ' + target + ' kg' : '按自己的节奏，记录变化'}}</text><text class="link">记录 ›</text></view><view class="muted">当前体重 {{current}}{{current !== '未记录' ? ' kg' : ''}}</view><block wx:if="{{goal && goal.percent !== null}}"><view class="progress"><view class="progress-fill" style="width: {{goal.percent}}%"></view></view><view class="muted">阶段进度 {{goal.percent}}%</view></block></view><view wx:if="{{imageError}}" class="error-box" bindtap="retryImage">{{imageError}}</view><view wx:if="{{changing}}" class="muted stack">正在保存图片设置…</view><view class="quote">每一个小小的选择，都在为你积累力量。</view><block wx:if="{{card.status === 'active'}}"><view class="section"><view class="section-title">选择喜欢的图片</view><view wx:if="{{presetError}}" class="muted" bindtap="load">图库加载失败 · 点击重试</view><view wx:elif="{{!presets.length}}" class="muted">系统图库正在准备中，拼图进度会为你保留。</view><view class="presets"><cloud-image wx:for="{{presets}}" wx:key="_id" class="preset" src="{{item.fileID}}" mode="aspectFit" data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="change" /></view><button class="soft-button stack" disabled="{{changing}}" bindtap="upload">上传我的图片</button><view class="muted stack">换图保留成功次数；比例变化时按新网格分配亮块。完成后图片锁定。</view></view></block><button wx:else class="action" loading="{{changing}}" disabled="{{changing}}" bindtap="background">设为我的主页背景</button></block></view>

